  "Training means reading the binder alone": "Entrenar es leer la carpeta a solas", "A tutor that quizzes, corrects and practises selling with every server": "Un tutor que pregunta, corrige y practica ventas con cada mesero",
  "Side work on a whiteboard, the same names every night": "El sidework en una pizarra, con los mismos nombres cada noche", "Side work built from the schedule, rotating so nobody gets yesterday's job": "El sidework sale del horario y rota, para que nadie repita la tarea de ayer",
